@startuml
title Use Case Diagram - Academic System SIAKAD
left to right direction

' ============ ACTORS ============
actor Mahasiswa
actor Dosen
actor "Admin Akademik" as AdminAkademik

' ============ SYSTEM BOUNDARY ============
rectangle "Academic System SIAKAD" {
    
    ' ============ CORE USE CASES ============
    usecase "Pendaftaran KRS" as UC1
    usecase "Approve KRS" as UC2
    usecase "Input Nilai" as UC3
    usecase "Generate Transkrip" as UC4
    
    ' ============ SUPPORTING USE CASES ============
    usecase "Lihat Mata Kuliah" as UC5
    usecase "Tambah Mata Kuliah ke KRS" as UC6
    usecase "Submit KRS" as UC7
    usecase "Validasi KRS" as UC8
    usecase "Lihat Nilai" as UC9
    usecase "Hitung IPK" as UC10
    usecase "Kelola Jadwal" as UC11
    usecase "Generate Laporan Akademik" as UC12
    usecase "Lihat Dashboard" as UC13
    usecase "Kelola Data Mahasiswa" as UC14
    usecase "Kelola Semester" as UC15
    
    ' ============ MAHASISWA RELATIONSHIPS ============
    Mahasiswa --> UC1 : creates
    Mahasiswa --> UC5 : views
    Mahasiswa --> UC6 : adds courses
    Mahasiswa --> UC7 : submits
    Mahasiswa --> UC9 : views own
    Mahasiswa --> UC4 : requests own
    Mahasiswa --> UC13 : accesses
    
    ' ============ DOSEN RELATIONSHIPS ============
    Dosen --> UC3 : inputs for courses
    Dosen --> UC9 : views for assigned courses
    Dosen --> UC11 : manages course schedules
    Dosen --> UC13 : accesses
    
    ' ============ ADMIN AKADEMIK RELATIONSHIPS ============
    AdminAkademik --> UC2 : approves/rejects
    AdminAkademik --> UC8 : validates
    AdminAkademik --> UC4 : generates for any student
    AdminAkademik --> UC10 : calculates
    AdminAkademik --> UC12 : generates reports
    AdminAkademik --> UC13 : accesses
    AdminAkademik --> UC14 : manages
    AdminAkademik --> UC15 : manages
    AdminAkademik --> UC11 : manages all schedules
    AdminAkademik --> UC5 : manages courses
    
    ' ============ INCLUDE RELATIONSHIPS ============
    UC1 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
    UC1 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
    UC2 ..> UC8 : <<include>>
    UC4 ..> UC10 : <<include>>
    UC10 ..> UC9 : <<include>>
    UC7 ..> UC8 : <<include>>
    
    ' ============ EXTEND RELATIONSHIPS ============
    UC6 ..> UC8 : <<extend>>
    UC12 ..> UC4 : <<extend>>
    UC3 ..> UC10 : <<extend>>
    
}

note right of UC1
  Mahasiswa dapat membuat KRS baru
  pada periode yang ditentukan
  dengan memilih mata kuliah
  yang tersedia
end note

note right of UC2
  Admin Akademik dapat menyetujui
  atau menolak KRS yang telah
  disubmit oleh mahasiswa
end note

note right of UC3
  Dosen dapat menginput nilai
  untuk mata kuliah yang diampu
  berdasarkan enrollment mahasiswa
end note

note right of UC4
  Sistem dapat generate transkrip
  berdasarkan nilai yang telah
  diinput dan enrollment yang
  completed
end note

@enduml